{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.Mass.KohnoWeightedClass","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.Mass.KohnoWeightedClass","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.Mass.KohnoWeighted","lean:module:QOU.Torsion.MassTraceMarkovClass"],"declarations":1,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.KohnoWeightedClass.massClass_kz","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.KohnoWeightedClass.massClass_kz","kind":"theorem","line":29,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/KohnoWeightedClass.lean#L29-L48","doc":"**The mass identity on braid classes, KZ form.** For a complex coupling `κ` with\n`q = e^{2πiκ}` not a root of unity, the mass of the class of a braid `β` on `m+1` strands is the\nframing-corrected site-weighted trace of the KZ holonomy representation `kzHeckeC` of `β`'s image\nin the Hecke algebra. The left side depends only on the class, so the right side is the same for\nevery representative. ","signatureChunk":0}]}